The Zhang Laboratory is dedicated to the innovation of novel reaction methodologies. We seek to discover molecular structure and reactivity that can contribute to interdisciplinary solutions for challenges in human health. Specifically, we emphasize synthetic organic chemistry, with focused expertise in the synthesis of <em>N</em>-heterocycles and 3D-Shaped scaffolds.These efforts are directed toward to develop practical access to molecules of interest in chemical biology, medicinal chemistry.